[{"answer":"Oh, Peter, there you are.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/1.mp3"},{"answer":"You've been ages. What kept you so long?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm sorry I'm so late, Sally.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you been waiting long?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, half an hour.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/5.mp3"},{"answer":"But it doesn't matter.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/6.mp3"},{"answer":"I've had a coffee and I've been reading this guidebook for tourists.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Sit down.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/8.mp3"},{"answer":"You look very hot and tired.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/9.mp3"},{"answer":"What would you like to drink?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/10.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd love a really chilled mineral water or something.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Will you have another coffee?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I will.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/13.mp3"},{"answer":"The waitress will be back in a moment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Why were you so late?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Did something happen?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/17.mp3"},{"answer":"You know, I went to the bank to cash some travellers cheques?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, the exchange rate was looking healthy, but...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/19.mp3"},{"answer":"when I went to the teller, they told me the computer system was temporarily down,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/20.mp3"},{"answer":"so they couldn't do any transactions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/21.mp3"},{"answer":"They said the problem would be fixed in a few minutes, so I waited.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/22.mp3"},{"answer":"And then I started talking to another guy in the bank,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/23.mp3"},{"answer":"and I forgot the time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, really?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Someone you met in the bank?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Does he work there?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/27.mp3"},{"answer":"No, he was a tourist, from New York.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/28.mp3"},{"answer":"His name's Henry,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/29.mp3"},{"answer":"and he's been here for a week, but he's moving on to Germany tomorrow.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/30.mp3"},{"answer":"He's an architect,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/31.mp3"},{"answer":"and he's spending four weeks travelling around Europe.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Just like us!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, just like us.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/34.mp3"},{"answer":"He told me the names of some places where we should eat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Great food, and not too expensive, he said.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, and he also gave me this map of the bus system.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/37.mp3"},{"answer":"He said he didn't need it any more.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/38.mp3"},{"answer":"That's useful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Pity he's moving on tomorrow.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah, here's the waitress. Let's order.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you want anything to eat, or shall we just have a drink?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'm hungry,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/43.mp3"},{"answer":"and we've got a lot of sightseeing to do, so let's just have a snack and a drink.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Sounds good to me!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, let's decide what we'll see today.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/46.mp3"},{"answer":"I guess the best place to start is the Cathedral,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/47.mp3"},{"answer":"and then the Castle.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/48.mp3"},{"answer":"What are the opening times for those two?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, according to this guidebook,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/50.mp3"},{"answer":"the Cathedral is only open from 9:30 in the morning until midday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/51.mp3"},{"answer":"No, hang on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/52.mp3"},{"answer":"That's the Cathedral Museum.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/53.mp3"},{"answer":"The Cathedral itself is open morning and afternoon.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/54.mp3"},{"answer":"The Castle is just open from one to five,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/55.mp3"},{"answer":"so we can't go there until after lunch.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/56.mp3"},{"answer":"I really want to spend some time in the Art Gallery,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/57.mp3"},{"answer":"because they've got this wonderful painting by Rembrandt that I've always wanted to see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/58.mp3"},{"answer":"What else should we see?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, the guidebook says the Botanical Gardens are worth spending some time in,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/60.mp3"},{"answer":"and they're open all day, from eight to six, so we can go there any time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/61.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd like to go to the Markets near the river too, but...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/62.mp3"},{"answer":"oh... no, wait, that's only in the mornings, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/63.mp3"},{"answer":"As well as today and tomorrow, we can see some other places on Monday, you know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/64.mp3"},{"answer":"But I don't think the Markets will be open then: they only open on Thursdays,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/65.mp3"},{"answer":"so we've missed them for this week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe we should go to the Cathedral today","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/67.mp3"},{"answer":"because it's Sunday tomorrow, and even though it's open every day,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/68.mp3"},{"answer":"it might be more difficult to get in tomorrow because of the church services.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/69.mp3"},{"answer":"That's true,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/70.mp3"},{"answer":"but the Art Gallery isn't open on Sundays at all,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/71.mp3"},{"answer":"so we'll have to go there today.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/72.mp3"},{"answer":"The Castle's open every day except Mondays, so we're okay there,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/73.mp3"},{"answer":"and the Gardens of course only close at night.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Are all these places free or do we have to pay to go in?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/75.mp3"},{"answer":"What does the guidebook say?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/76.mp3"},{"answer":"I think there's a charge for all of them except the Botanical Gardens.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, and the Markets, of course you don't pay to go in.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/79.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, it looks like our plan is this:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/80.mp3"},{"answer":"we'll go to see the painting you like first, the Rembrandt,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/81.mp3"},{"answer":"then have lunch and go on to the Castle after that, and then the Cathedral.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/82.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/83.mp3"},{"answer":"It says here that the roof of the Cathedral is really beautiful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/84.mp3"},{"answer":"Is that right?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/85.mp3"},{"answer":"What I really want to do at the Cathedral is climb the tower.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/86.mp3"},{"answer":"The view is supposed to be spectacular.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/87.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, well, that'll be more than enough for today.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/88.mp3"},{"answer":"Then, tomorrow, let's go to the Botanical Gardens and have a picnic.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/89.mp3"},{"answer":"I want to sit by the river and watch the swans.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/90.mp3"},{"answer":"This city's famous for them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-1-2023-08-11-20-37-42/91.mp3"}]
